{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SIN CARDS</strong> is a horror-themed card game where you must build the ultimate deck to survive the nightmares of the Netherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/A8.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/A5.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/A11.png?t=1742697770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbCombine strategy and luck as you collect and purchase powerful cards, craft deadly combos, and face off against terrifying monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/A6.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/A9.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/A14.png?t=1742697770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbDemons gradually grow stronger and more aggressive under the control of Delilah, the sinister voice of the Netherworld, a manipulative and mocking presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/darkfantasy-disciple.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/hellmaw.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/darkfantasy-enthralled.png?t=1742697770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbEach level introduces increasing difficulty and new mechanics like crafting, mining, and fishing. Craft hero items using resources and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/Items_-_Copy.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/1234.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/craft.png?t=1742697770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbCreepy choices, eerie sounds, and sudden jumpscares will have you second-guessing every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/tweety.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/swarm_exploder.png?t=1742697770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbEach new level reveals more lore about the Sin Cards and the demons that inhabit the world.\u00a0Some say the choices you make reveal the lengths you're willing to go to survive permadeath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/TESTDeckIcon.png?t=1742697770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3414590?t=1742697770","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742697770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/3d3fe62432e812e14f30faaca0e2a3ba2f9fb27f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742697770","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/3d3fe62432e812e14f30faaca0e2a3ba2f9fb27f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742697770","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Includes Source SDK","id":16}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The SIN CARDS feature mature themes, including blood, gore, and suggestive imagery. Rooms may also be filled with blood and strange sounds."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SIN CARDS</strong> is a horror-themed card game where you must build the ultimate deck to survive the nightmares of the Netherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/A8.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/A5.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/A11.png?t=1742697770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbCombine strategy and luck as you collect and purchase powerful cards, craft deadly combos, and face off against terrifying monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/A6.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/A9.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/A14.png?t=1742697770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbDemons gradually grow stronger and more aggressive under the control of Delilah, the sinister voice of the Netherworld, a manipulative and mocking presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/darkfantasy-disciple.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/hellmaw.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/darkfantasy-enthralled.png?t=1742697770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbEach level introduces increasing difficulty and new mechanics like crafting, mining, and fishing. Craft hero items using resources and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/Items_-_Copy.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/1234.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/craft.png?t=1742697770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbCreepy choices, eerie sounds, and sudden jumpscares will have you second-guessing every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/tweety.png?t=1742697770\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/swarm_exploder.png?t=1742697770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbEach new level reveals more lore about the Sin Cards and the demons that inhabit the world.\u00a0Some say the choices you make reveal the lengths you're willing to go to survive permadeath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/extras/TESTDeckIcon.png?t=1742697770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Wynand Smit"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3411930","name":"SIN CARDS: Welcome to the Netherworld"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414590/0fa113905a3f3e30137bf924a0b5b51293db8894/header.jpg?t=1742697770","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"SIN CARDS: Welcome to the Netherworld Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows\u00ae 7/8/8.1/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated or dedicated sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Best experienced with sound.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows\u00ae 7/8/8.1/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2+ GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL ES 2.0 hardware driver support required for WebGL acceleration. (AMD Catalyst 10.9, nVidia 358.50)<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated or dedicated sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Best experienced with sound.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Wynand Smit"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nMedo\nNudez","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror\nSexuelle Andeutungen","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"26 Feb, 2025"},"required_age":0,"short_description":"SIN CARDS is a horror deckbuilder where every card brings you closer to salvation or damnation. Face terrifying demons, uncover dark lore, and survive a world of permadeath where every choice could be your last.","steam_appid":3414590,"support_info":{"email":"LightSmit5@Gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"demo","website":null}